

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Prograam faraay: 0.

>> a := Jokkalante ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dëgg ; Dara ; 666.
a def jële-ci-gannaaw jële-ci-ndorte yokk-ci-ndorte: ['hi'], yokk-ci-mujj: 999, noppi.
Génn bind: ( a boole: [','] ), taxaw.

Prograam faaral-njaboot.
usedMemory1 := (Prograam xalaat ? 0).


a := Jokkalante ← ['hello'] ; ['world'] ; Dëgg ; Dara ; 666.
a jële-ci-gannaaw. a jële-ci-ndorte. a yokk-ci-ndorte: ['hi'], yokk-ci-mujj: 999.
